# AI Accessibility

- Use semantic regions for AI message lists (`role="log"`, `aria-live="polite"`)
- Do not steal focus during streaming updates
- Ensure all actions are keyboard accessible
- Provide accessible labels for AI actions and controls
- Add alt text or labels for AI-generated media
- Do not rely on color alone to convey AI vs user content
